                        "entry_id": "25b4429d-5ba4-3b1f-8391-ad473f308203",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A man's overcoat; a close-bodied frock coat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce5e195c-e2f7-444e-acf3-9e8a8cf36107",
                                "sense_id": "d4b73737-3235-35ff-9629-29ba736352f7",
                                "text": "Yes, I was right: it was Mr. Brocklehurst, buttoned up in a surtout, and looking longer, narrower, and more rigid than ever."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "839c657a-81c8-467f-9b9d-991282d23dc1",
                                "sense_id": "d4b73737-3235-35ff-9629-29ba736352f7",
                                "text": "The house had been new painted, and smelt of varnish and turpentine, and a large streak of white paint inflicted itself on the back of the old boy’s fur-collared surtout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2939a17b-fbd8-48df-b965-524e1298e8ef",
                                "sense_id": "d4b73737-3235-35ff-9629-29ba736352f7",
                                "text": "He was dressed in the suit he'd bought for his mother's funeral, beaver top hat, silk surtout."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8056f06b-9a9d-3d11-bb46-1485a015df32",
